From: Nick Schuetz <nschuetz@redhat.com>
Subject: [PATCH] AzCore/Script: Lua 5.5 runtime compat (registry refs, GC step, dump writer)

Patch0010 and Patch0011 make the engine compile against Lua 5.5, but three
runtime differences remained. On Fedora 45 (system Lua 5.5.1) every Script
Canvas graph crashes the Editor as soon as it runs.

1. Registry references. luaL_ref hands out 4, 5, 6... on both Lua 5.4 and 5.5,
   but Lua 5.5 raised LUA_RIDX_LAST from 2 to 3 and keeps the reference free
   list at index 1. AzCore computes its fixed registry slots as
   LUA_RIDX_LAST + 2 .. + 6, so on 5.5 every slot is one too high:
     "Table reference should match 5 but is instead 4!" (ScriptContext.cpp)
   ScriptContext::FromNativeContext then reads registry[5], gets the globals
   table instead of the ScriptContext light userdata, lua_touserdata returns
   NULL, and Script Canvas crashes in ScriptContext::GetBoundContext():
     #0 AZ::ScriptContext::GetBoundContext() const + 14
     #1 ScriptCanvas::ExecutionStateHandler::Execute() + 376
   Use LUA_RIDX_LAST + 1 .. + 5 on Lua 5.5.

2. LUA_GCSTEP takes a byte count on Lua 5.5 (KiB on 5.4). Convert so
   GarbageCollectStep keeps its KiB meaning.

3. lua_dump on Lua 5.5 can call the writer with size 0. Return early in both
   LuaStreamWriter implementations.

All of this mirrors upstream o3de/o3de#20313 (development moved to Lua 5.5.1,
merged 2026-11-19). Unlike upstream, the registry and GC changes are guarded
on LUA_VERSION_NUM >= 505 so 26.10 builds against Lua 5.4 (Fedora 44,
CentOS Stream 10, bundled 5.4.4) are unchanged.

---
diff --git a/Code/Framework/AzCore/AzCore/Script/ScriptContext.cpp b/Code/Framework/AzCore/AzCore/Script/ScriptContext.cpp
index 5d8e1bc..1d669e2 100644
--- a/Code/Framework/AzCore/AzCore/Script/ScriptContext.cpp
+++ b/Code/Framework/AzCore/AzCore/Script/ScriptContext.cpp
@@ -5913,7 +5913,13 @@ LUA_API const Node* lua_getDummyNode()
     //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     void ScriptContext::GarbageCollectStep(int numberOfSteps)
     {
+#if LUA_VERSION_NUM >= 505
+        // Lua 5.5 takes a byte count for LUA_GCSTEP; Lua 5.4 took KiB. Keep the KiB meaning.
+        const size_t stepBytes = static_cast<size_t>(numberOfSteps > 0 ? numberOfSteps : 0) * 1024;
+        lua_gc(m_impl->m_lua, LUA_GCSTEP, stepBytes);
+#else
         lua_gc(m_impl->m_lua, LUA_GCSTEP, numberOfSteps);
+#endif
     }
 
     //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
diff --git a/Code/Framework/AzCore/AzCore/Script/lua/lua.h b/Code/Framework/AzCore/AzCore/Script/lua/lua.h
index a184f73..c1e4b25 100644
--- a/Code/Framework/AzCore/AzCore/Script/lua/lua.h
+++ b/Code/Framework/AzCore/AzCore/Script/lua/lua.h
@@ -15,12 +15,22 @@ extern "C" {
 }
 
 // Currently we support Lua 5.4.4 and later
-// note that Lua 5.x defines LUA_RID_LAST + 1 to be an index of a free-list.
+#if LUA_VERSION_NUM >= 505
+// Lua 5.5 stores the reference free list at index 1 and raised LUA_RIDX_LAST
+// from 2 to 3, so the first new reference follows LUA_RIDX_LAST.
+#define AZ_LUA_SCRIPT_CONTEXT_REF       LUA_RIDX_LAST + 1
+#define AZ_LUA_GLOBALS_TABLE_REF        LUA_RIDX_LAST + 2
+#define AZ_LUA_CLASS_TABLE_REF          LUA_RIDX_LAST + 3
+#define AZ_LUA_WEAK_CACHE_TABLE_REF     LUA_RIDX_LAST + 4
+#define AZ_LUA_ERROR_HANDLER_FUN_REF    LUA_RIDX_LAST + 5
+#else
+// note that Lua 5.4 defines LUA_RID_LAST + 1 to be an index of a free-list.
 #define AZ_LUA_SCRIPT_CONTEXT_REF       LUA_RIDX_LAST + 2
 #define AZ_LUA_GLOBALS_TABLE_REF        LUA_RIDX_LAST + 3
 #define AZ_LUA_CLASS_TABLE_REF          LUA_RIDX_LAST + 4
 #define AZ_LUA_WEAK_CACHE_TABLE_REF     LUA_RIDX_LAST + 5
 #define AZ_LUA_ERROR_HANDLER_FUN_REF    LUA_RIDX_LAST + 6
+#endif
 
 #define AZ_LUA_CLASS_METATABLE_NAME_INDEX 1 // can we always read the name from the behavior class???
 #define AZ_LUA_CLASS_METATABLE_BEHAVIOR_CLASS 2
diff --git a/Code/Framework/AzFramework/AzFramework/Script/ScriptComponent.cpp b/Code/Framework/AzFramework/AzFramework/Script/ScriptComponent.cpp
index 94e7345..8644cd0 100644
--- a/Code/Framework/AzFramework/AzFramework/Script/ScriptComponent.cpp
+++ b/Code/Framework/AzFramework/AzFramework/Script/ScriptComponent.cpp
@@ -46,6 +46,11 @@ namespace ScriptComponentCpp
 
     int LuaStreamWriter(lua_State*, const void* data, size_t size, void* userData)
     {
+        if (size == 0)
+        {
+            return 0;
+        }
+
         using namespace AZ::IO;
         GenericStream* stream = static_cast<GenericStream*>(userData);
 
diff --git a/Gems/LmbrCentral/Code/Source/Builders/LuaBuilder/LuaHelpers.cpp b/Gems/LmbrCentral/Code/Source/Builders/LuaBuilder/LuaHelpers.cpp
index eb66d73..f1231fc 100644
--- a/Gems/LmbrCentral/Code/Source/Builders/LuaBuilder/LuaHelpers.cpp
+++ b/Gems/LmbrCentral/Code/Source/Builders/LuaBuilder/LuaHelpers.cpp
@@ -23,6 +23,11 @@ namespace LuaBuilder
     {
         static int LuaStreamWriter(lua_State*, const void* data, size_t size, void* userData)
         {
+            if (size == 0)
+            {
+                return 0;
+            }
+
             using namespace AZ::IO;
             GenericStream* stream = static_cast<GenericStream*>(userData);
 
